data_case_c_nesting
#
# Case C: apo (70%) vs bound (30%); the bound state nests two ligand poses (0.20 + 0.10).
# Tyr120 is the gate residue (B = apo, A = bound) sitting in a short grey poly-ALA chain;
# LIG301 is the ligand, present only in the bound branch. The nesting forbids a ligand
# co-occurring with apo, with NO exclusion row. base = everything single-conformer.
#
